        "description": "<h1><a name=\"Richfixtureheading\"></a>Rich fixture heading</h1>\n\n<h2><a name=\"Secondlevelheading\"></a>Second-level heading</h2>\n\n<p>Paragraph with <b>bold</b>, <em>italic</em>, <tt>inline code</tt> and a <a href=\"https://example.com/docs?a=1&amp;b=2\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">link to example</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Mention: <a href=\"https://example-site.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" data-account-id=\"557058:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" accountid=\"557058:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Fixture User</a> please look.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>bullet one</li>\n\t<li>bullet two\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>nested bullet</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>first</li>\n\t<li>second</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-go\"><span class=\"code-keyword\">func</span> main() {\n\tfmt.Println(<span class=\"code-quote\">\"hello &lt;vincent&gt; &amp; co\"</span>)\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class='table-wrap'>\n<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>Header A</th>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>Header B</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>cell 1</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>cell 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>cell 3</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>cell 4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"10000_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10000\" title=\"fixture.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"10000\" file-preview-title=\"fixture.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://example-site.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/10000?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://example-site.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/10000\" filename=\"fixture.png\"><img src=\"https://example-site.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/10000\" data-attachment-name=\"fixture.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"b5bd82f6-1186-4d5a-adbc-8a80a8059d7d\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\" /></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>\n\n<blockquote><p>A quoted line.</p></blockquote>",
